  "prefLabel": "Puc 702.06 Sewage disposal service",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 702.06 \"Sewage disposal service\" means the collection, transportation, treatment, and disposal of sewage including but not limited to the active processing of sewage to remove impurities and its ultimate discharge in the environment. This definition does not include septic pumping.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note # 1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Puc 700) #13889, eff 4-22-24",
